  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 10880,
      "text": "Let's take a detailed look at how this traditional irrigation machine works, focusing on its"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 10880,
      "endMs": 13440,
      "text": "five main components."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 13440,
      "endMs": 17040,
      "text": "First, the inlet pipe."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 17040,
      "endMs": 20520,
      "text": "This is the part through which water enters the machine."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 20520,
      "endMs": 25760,
      "text": "You'll find it positioned low to the ground right at the back end of the system."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 25760,
      "endMs": 32480,
      "text": "It's connected to a nearby water source, such as a river or pond, and its main role is"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 32480,
      "endMs": 36080,
      "text": "to draw water into the pumping mechanism."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 36080,
      "endMs": 39680,
      "text": "Without it, the machine wouldn't be able to function."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 39680,
      "endMs": 42800,
      "text": "Next, we have the treadle."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 42800,
      "endMs": 50160,
      "text": "This is the long pedal that runs along the top of the machine and extends toward the back."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 50160,
      "endMs": 55160,
      "text": "Farmers use it by stepping on it repeatedly, which drives the system."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 55160,
      "endMs": 60880,
      "text": "The pressure from their foot moves other parts of the machine, allowing water to be lifted"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 60880,
      "endMs": 63760,
      "text": "and pushed forward."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 63760,
      "endMs": 66200,
      "text": "Now let's look at the cylinder."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 66200,
      "endMs": 70960,
      "text": "This is one of the two vertical chambers in the centre of the machine."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 70960,
      "endMs": 74160,
      "text": "It's shaped like a tall tube."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 74160,
      "endMs": 79480,
      "text": "As the treadle is pushed, the cylinder fills with water and helps pressurise it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 79480,
      "endMs": 83040,
      "text": "Inside the cylinder, we find the piston."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 83040,
      "endMs": 88200,
      "text": "This part moves up and down rapidly to create the suction needed to pull water into the"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 88200,
      "endMs": 91120,
      "text": "cylinder and then push it out."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 91120,
      "endMs": 95840,
      "text": "It's a rod-like device connected to the treadle by a series of levers."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 95840,
      "endMs": 98960,
      "text": "Finally, the discharge pipe."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 98960,
      "endMs": 103360,
      "text": "This pipe is located on the side near the base of the machine."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 103360,
      "endMs": 108920,
      "text": "Once the water is pressurised, it exits through the discharge pipe and flows into channels"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 108920,
      "endMs": 110520,
      "text": "that carry it to the fields."
    }
  ],
